t Lands in Early Access offers a voxel world with a unique visual style that can be discovered and shaped both in diorama and fully immersed.\n\n**Available now:**\n- Beautiful voxel world with various biomes\n- Volumetric world diorama the size of a paper to your whole living room floor\n- Day / night cycle\n- Empty diorama to build without distractions\n- Effortlessly place and remove blocks directly with your hands, or with controllers\n- Intuitive tools for quick construction\n- Virtual camera to record and share your builds\n\n**Coming soon:**\n\n- Climb the leaderboards in multiplayer build battles\n- Group up in creative multiplayer\n- Cave systems and underground biomes\n- More surface biomes\n- Creatures roaming the lands", "short_description": "Build, dig and discover in the Pocket Lands! Open a diorama the size of your lap to the whole living room floor and shape the beautifully stylized world directly with your hands. Or, drop in and immerse yourself fully in the boundless lands waiting to be explored."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://pocket-lands.com/privacy-policy-quest", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Mountainborn Studios Lda", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://pocket-lands.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1725996564472128"}, {"id": "1990104051447093"}, {"id": "1676485315806614"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING", "OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "us